$NetBSD$

AICSemi AIC8800D80 firmware, copied unmodified from the vendor SDK at
os/aic8800 (radxa-pkg packaging, 5.0+git20260123.5f7be68d,
src/USB/driver_fw/fw/aic8800D80/).  Only the non-IPC u02 variant files
that the RK3568 Linux ground truth exercised are packaged:

  fmacfw_8800d80_u02.bin        main firmware      -> RAM 0x00110000
  fw_adid_8800d80_u02.bin       ADID               -> RAM 0x00161928
  fw_patch_8800d80_u02.bin      ROM patch          -> RAM 0x00100000
  fw_patch_table_8800d80_u02.bin  chip-rev table   (parsed, not downloaded)
  lmacfw_rf_8800d80_u02.bin     RF calibration     (app stage)
  aic_userconfig_8800d80.txt    power/channel config (app stage)
  aic_powerlimit_8800d80.txt    power limits       (app stage)
  calibmode_8800d80.bin         calibration mode   (app stage)

The firmware binaries are the AICSemi redistributable payloads shipped
with the vendor SDK; the NetBSD driver (aic8800u) is a clean-room
implementation and contains no vendor source.
